        "feature":"feature salt {\n# Stylistic Alternates\n\n#> feature\n  sub Eng from [Eng.ss01 Eng.ss02 Eng.ss03];\n  sub I from [I.ss05];\n  sub IJ from [IJ.ss05];\n  sub Iacute from [Iacute.ss05];\n  sub Ibreve from [Ibreve.ss05];\n  sub Icaron from [Icaron.ss05];\n  sub Icircumflex from [Icircumflex.ss05];\n  sub Idblgrave from [Idblgrave.ss05];\n  sub Idieresis from [Idieresis.ss05];\n  sub Idieresisacute from [Idieresisacute.ss05];\n  sub Idotaccent from [Idotaccent.ss05];\n  sub Idotbelow from [Idotbelow.ss05];\n  sub Igrave from [Igrave.ss05];\n  sub Ihookabove from [Ihookabove.ss05];\n  sub Iinvertedbreve from [Iinvertedbreve.ss05];\n  sub Imacron from [Imacron.ss05];\n  sub Iogonek from [Iogonek.ss05];\n  sub Itilde from [Itilde.ss05];\n  sub Itildebelow from [Itildebelow.ss05];\n  sub Omega from [Omega.salt];\n  sub Upsilondasia from [Upsilondasia.salt];\n  sub Upsilondasiaoxia from [Upsilondasiaoxia.salt];\n  sub Upsilondasiaperispomeni from [Upsilondasiaperispomeni.salt];\n  sub Upsilondasiavaria from [Upsilondasiavaria.salt];\n  sub Upsilonmacron from [Upsilonmacron.salt];\n  sub Upsilonoxia from [Upsilonoxia.salt];\n  sub Upsilonvaria from [Upsilonvaria.salt];\n  sub Upsilonvrachy from [Upsilonvrachy.salt];\n  sub beta from [beta.salt];\n  sub commaaccentcomb from [commaaccentcomb.salt];\n  sub florin from [florin.salt];\n  sub g from [g.salt];\n  sub gacute from [gacute.salt];\n  sub gbreve from [gbreve.salt];\n  sub gcaron from [gcaron.salt];\n  sub gcircumflex from [gcircumflex.salt];\n  sub gcommaaccent from [gcommaaccent.salt];\n  sub gdotaccent from [gdotaccent.salt];\n  sub gmacron from [gmacron.salt];\n  sub gstroke from [gstroke.salt];\n  sub ij from [ij.ss06];\n  sub l from [l.ss05];\n  sub lacute from [lacute.ss05];\n  sub lbar from [lbar.ss05];\n  sub lcaron from [lcaron.ss05];\n  sub lcircumflexbelow from [lcircumflexbelow.ss05];\n  sub lcommaaccent from [lcommaaccent.ss05];\n  sub ldotbelow from [ldotbelow.ss05];\n  sub ldotbelowmacron