        "feature":"feature dlig {\n# GSUB feature: Discretionary Ligatures\n# Lookups: 1\n\n  sub c h by c_h;\n  sub c k by c_k;\n  sub c t by c_t;\n  sub ccedilla t by ccedilla_t;\n  sub s t by s_t;\n  sub scedilla t by scedilla_t;\n\n} dlig;\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
